An integrated electrical-power-system investigation (@pe-integrated: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Hydroelectric-Mechanical-and-Electrical-Design-USACE.lingua#r_1N0D32HTSXMVJ1VRW9TNTYV9P8", #source "../sources/MATPOWER-User-Manual-8-1.lingua#r_5ANPNGQHP93EVQXR6FW357WSEV", #source "../sources/Power-System-Dynamics-and-Control-Kulkarni.lingua#r_2T4WS3TCPCXRB5JEH7HTN5FAHQ", #source "../sources/Commissioning-Guide-Hydroelectric-FIST.lingua#r_0WA7RR86PMVEA3FFM7CG6NQ5RM", #source "../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC", #electrical-power-engineering "../research/Independent-power-engineering-scholarship-and-revision.lingua#r_3KS8BF3MHCY6ZF25STX8AJ4MHN") { r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3
**Read:** [Mechanical and Electrical Design of Hydroelectric Power Plants — USACE](../sources/Hydroelectric-Mechanical-and-Electrical-Design-USACE.lingua#r_1N0D32HTSXMVJ1VRW9TNTYV9P8), complete applicable facility/system design chapters; [MATPOWER User’s Manual, version 8.1](../sources/MATPOWER-User-Manual-8-1.lingua#r_5ANPNGQHP93EVQXR6FW357WSEV), whole relevant steady-state model/methods; [Power System Dynamics and Control — A. M. Kulkarni](../sources/Power-System-Dynamics-and-Control-Kulkarni.lingua#r_2T4WS3TCPCXRB5JEH7HTN5FAHQ), complete applicable dynamic methods; [Commissioning Guide for Hydroelectric Facilities — FIST 4-7](../sources/Commissioning-Guide-Hydroelectric-FIST.lingua#r_0WA7RR86PMVEA3FFM7CG6NQ5RM), entire relevant integration/evidence treatment; [Conduct of power operations and maintenance — FIST](../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC), both complete operating/maintenance contexts.

Choose a real or fully documented bounded service: a source/transformer/feeder/process installation, a drive/auxiliary system, a converter-supported island or a facility power subsystem. State useful output, duty, operating conditions, source/energy and material origin, normal/fault paths, control/protection, measurement and the maintenance/restoration boundary.

Build a hierarchy from independent hand limits through network/field/device and dynamic models to actual test observables. Derive power/energy balance, bases and controls; check load flow, equipment duties, protection, relevant transient/stability behavior and service limits. Independently verify restricted calculations and establish numerical convergence. Compare at least two arrangements and a changed condition not used in tuning.

Join as-designed/as-built and calibration/condition/settings evidence with construction, commissioning, operation and maintenance. Include auxiliaries, skills, spares and common causes that determine continuing service. Use suitable supervised physical work or a full authorized public case, clearly identifying what kind of capability is demonstrated. The final defended argument should let another specialist trace a practical decision from useful function through models, complete methods, observations and uncertainty, without trusting an ideal component label or a simulation alone.

**Continue:** [Independent power-engineering scholarship and revision](../research/Independent-power-engineering-scholarship-and-revision.lingua#r_3KS8BF3MHCY6ZF25STX8AJ4MHN).

